(7516207, 1200306, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>What a great idea and well executed, thoroughly deserving of your HM and score, well done Susan. I enjoyed reading your notes, what a lot of effort but well worth it. The pasta figure is so dynamic and the lighting really effective it works beautifully. It is a great idea but what would have made it work even better would have been better use of the space on the left for an admiring vegetable audience looking longingly at the gyrations of this wonderful pasta danca...</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well. What a great idea and well executed, thoroughly deserving of your HM and score, well done Susan. I enjoyed reading your notes, what a lot of effort but well worth it. The pasta figure is so dynamic and the lighting really effective it works beautifully. It is a great idea but what would have made it work even better would have been better use of the space on the left for an admiring vegetable audience looking longingly at the gyrations of this wonderful pasta danca...', '2017-05-31 11:18:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7516213, 1199881, 86447, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> looks like he''s taking a leek on the floor </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hahahahahaha!<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your HM!   Such a fun image!<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: looks like he''s taking a leek on the floor   Hahahahahaha! Congratulations on your HM!   Such a fun image!', '2017-05-31 11:38:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7516214, 1200295, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An amusing image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>Ah, its great to be a kid again! Your shot demonstrates a great sense of humour and imagination, well done Susie. Quite a bit of effort has gone into creating this humorous scene but also a lot of fun too, I like your carrot hombres with wire arms and legs, tee hee. The one thing that does let it down overall is the right hand side where your background softens to be met by a perfectly focused tree but the important ting here is the concept which works well. Thanks for the laugh...</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An amusing image that meets the challenge well. Ah, its great to be a kid again! Your shot demonstrates a great sense of humour and imagination, well done Susie. Quite a bit of effort has gone into creating this humorous scene but also a lot of fun too, I like your carrot hombres with wire arms and legs, tee hee. The one thing that does let it down overall is the right hand side where your background softens to be met by a perfectly focused tree but the important ting here is the concept which works well. Thanks for the laugh...', '2017-05-31 11:38:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7516215, 1200166, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An amusing image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>This is a great take on the challenge, instantly recognisable even if I dont recognise the title, over here its known as pacman. Its a simple but very effective idea that works really well. The lighting is good and the camera control is good too, theres not really anything to fault about it, well done for making front page Joe.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An amusing image that meets the challenge well. This is a great take on the challenge, instantly recognisable even if I dont recognise the title, over here its known as pacman. Its a simple but very effective idea that works really well. The lighting is good and the camera control is good too, theres not really anything to fault about it, well done for making front page Joe.', '2017-05-31 11:44:19.000000', NULL, 0),
